{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08654","headline":"登巴陵开元寺西阁赠衡岳僧方外 · 李白","name":"登巴陵开元寺西阁赠衡岳僧方外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衡岳有阐士，五峯秀真骨。\n见君万里心，海水照秋月。\n大臣南溟去，问道皆请谒。\n洒以甘露言，清凉润肌发。\n明湖落天镜，香阁凌银阙。\n登眺餐惠风，新花期啓发。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}